                    "value": "<p>The knucklehead drops to all fours, or stands upright. While on all fours and not @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone], the knucklehead's walking Speed is 50 feet, its [[/act long-jump]] and [[/act high-jump]] distance is equal to its Speed, and it can't use its arm hand Strike.</p>"
